Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "NighttimeAnimalObstacleScenario" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1, :obstacle2, :obstacle3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Statue-like animal figure in road" .
:obstacle2 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Large animal figure on right side of road" .
:obstacle3 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Animal figure in background" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition ;
    :description "Low visibility due to nighttime" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with road object (animal statue)" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :evidence1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Occlusion risk due to low visibility and multiple road objects" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :evidence1 .

:risk3 a :DistractionRisk ;
    :description "Distraction risk from unusual road objects" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 ;
    :indicatesPotentialRisk :evidence1 .

:evidence1 a :EvidenceIndicator ;
    :description "Multiple road objects obstructing path and reducing visibility" .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: Potential collision with road object (animal statue)
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: Occlusion risk due to low visibility and multiple road objects
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 3:**
Description: Distraction risk from unusual road objects
Severity Score: 0.75